{"id":"v78t3k4jgibbrv3yo5k4p7qp8","title":"CFTC起诉路易斯安那州挑战预测市场禁令","originalTitle":"CFTC 起诉路易斯安那州，挑战预测市场禁令","summary":"美国商品期货交易委员会（CFTC）起诉路易斯安那州，要求阻止该州禁止受监管交易所提供事件合约的禁令。此为CFTC第12次针对州政府管辖权发起诉讼，且路易斯安那州法院此前未向被告充分通知或给予陈述机会。","reason":"CFTC通过起诉第12个州维护衍生品市场管辖权，为全国性政策博弈提供关键案例。","source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2304668"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T00:46:45.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T01:00:44.936Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T01:00:44.936Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚"],"score":83,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"85bc01a0-b7ae-4945-8121-958a1641fe9e","title":"CFTC起诉路易斯安那州挑战事件合约禁令"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"85bc01a0-b7ae-4945-8121-958a1641fe9e","title":"CFTC起诉路易斯安那州挑战事件合约禁令"}],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f2_ZvMZqcoP8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}